# Dependency Policy

- Add a package only with clear quality/security/time win, acceptable license/size, no duplicate, approval when large.
- No unapproved mass upgrades or framework swaps.
- Commit lockfiles; run ecosystem audits; don’t ignore Critical/High without recorded risk acceptance.
- Watch typosquatting and risky install scripts; remove unused deps after reference checks.

Korean rationale: `docs/pvc-guide/ko/runtime/dependency-policy.md`
